#. module: github_connector
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:github_connector.field_github_organization__organization_serie_ids
msgid "Organization Series"
msgstr "Series de Organización"

#. module: github_connector
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:github_connector.field_github_organization__organization_serie_ids
msgid ""
"Define here the series (e.g., '16.0', '17.0') to filter which branches are synchronized. Only branches matching these series will be synced."
msgstr ""
"Define aquí las series (ej. '16.0', '17.0') para filtrar qué ramas se sincronizan. Solo las ramas que coincidan serán sincronizadas."

